# Infrastructure / Deployment Instructions

- Treat environment, account, region, cluster, workspace, and artifact as explicit inputs.
- Plan/apply, build/push, and deploy/promote are separate authority steps.
- Require observability, canary/progressive rollout, stop thresholds, and rollback/forward repair.
- Never expose credentials in code, logs, prompts, or generated reports.
- Production writes, public DNS, IAM, secrets, and destructive operations require explicit approval.
